  "provider": "Irish Life",
  "product": "PRB",
  "notes": "Irish Life Complete Solutions Personal Retirement Bond (ILA 8993). Shares field naming with the Irish Life ARF (Text Field 5/6/7/8 name+DOB, Check Box 22 gender, Check Box 24 relationship, Text Field 30/31/32 COB/nationality/residence, Text Field 45 multi-line address, Text Field 44 county). Country of Birth left blank when absent from OnePage (not fabricated). Address box wraps street+town; county+Eircode go in the County field. Gender/relationship radios get a drawn mark at fill time. Transfer/scheme/PEP/fund/declaration sections are case-specific and left for the broker.",
  "field_map": {
    "__comment_page1": "=== PAGE 1: Adviser details ===",
    "Text Field 27": {
      "label": "Financial Adviser Name",
      "crm_field": null,
      "adviser_field": "name"
    },
    "Text Field 26": {
      "label": "Financial Adviser Code",
      "crm_field": null,
      "adviser_field": "agency_code"
    },
    "__comment_page2": "=== PAGE 2: Customer Details ===",
    "Text Field 6": {
      "label": "Title (Mr/Mrs/Ms etc)",
      "crm_field": "title"
    },
    "Text Field 5": {
      "label": "First Name",
      "crm_field": "first_name"
    },
    "Text Field 7": {
      "label": "Last Name",
      "crm_field": "last_name"
    },
    "Text Field 8": {
      "label": "Date of Birth (dd/mm/yyyy)",
      "crm_field": "birthday",
      "transform": "date_ddmmyyyy"
    },
    "Check Box 22": {
      "label": "Gender Male/Female",
      "crm_field": "gender",
      "radio_group": true,
      "radio_options": {
        "Yes": ["male"],
        "no": ["female"]
      }
    },
    "Check Box 24": {
      "label": "Relationship Status",
      "crm_field": "status",
      "radio_group": true,
      "radio_options": {
        "Yes": ["single"],
        "2": ["married"],
        "3": ["registered civil partner", "civil partner"],
        "4": ["separated"],
        "5": ["divorced"],
        "6": ["widowed", "widow(er)", "widower"]
      }
    },
    "Text Field 30": {
      "label": "Country of Birth",
      "crm_field": "country_of_birth"
    },
    "Text Field 31": {
      "label": "Nationality",
      "crm_field": "nationality"
    },
    "Text Field 32": {
